# QA-005: Distinguish hydroxide contamination from bicarbonate in an alkaline sample
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 NaOH 0.0004mol
add v1 Na2CO3 0.0003mol
titrate v1 HCl 0.1M 0.1mL until ph 8.3 max 150
inspect v1
titrate v1 HCl 0.1M 0.1mL until ph 4.5 max 100
inspect
